msgctxt "94\t377"
msgid ""
"I scrambled from east to west, searching for\\nJin Goda and investigating "
"Kaoru's past."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "462\t571"
msgid "Slowly, the truth about Kaoru's past\\nbegan to unravel."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "572\t742"
msgid ""
"And with it, so did her connection to\\nan incident that occurred 20 years "
"ago."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "772\t1023"
msgid "I discovered that my father and I were\\ndeeply involved."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1072\t1249"
msgid "Meanwhile in Kamurocho, an organization\\nwas working to get revenge..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1250\t1354"
msgid "...for what happened 20 years ago."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1413\t1473"
msgid "The Jingweon Mafia."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1522\t1707"
msgid "A foreign organization erased from\\nKamurocho by the Dojima Family."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1753\t1924"
msgid "The remaining members had come up\\nwith a desperate plan for revenge."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2003\t2190"
msgid "Kawara had been watching them for\\n20 years since the incident."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2232\t2414"
msgid ""
"When he picked up on their plan, he\\nrelayed the information to Kaoru and "
"me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2424\t2558"
msgid "We headed to Millennium Tower,\\nwhere the Jingweon Mafia awaited us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2608\t2798"
msgid ""
"It was a pathetic revenge plot orchestrated\\nby Kurahashi, an active police"
" chief."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2865\t3107"
msgid "In the end, Kurahashi and Kawara died at\\neach other's hands."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3330\t3440"
msgid "Thanks... for saving me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3530\t3670"
msgid "Maybe the first time I've done\\nanything dad-like, eh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3752\t3890"
msgid "God, I missed you... \\nHolding your hand like this..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3980\t4025"
msgid "Dad..."
msgstr "Papà..."

msgctxt "4105\t4180"
msgid "Thank you..."
msgstr "Grazie..."

msgctxt "4221\t4317"
msgid "At last, Kaoru learned the truth about\\nher past."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4346\t4491"
msgid ""
"As he lay dying, Kawara confessed the\\ntruth to Kaoru⑬that he was her "
"father."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4519\t4606"
msgid "Then he closed his eyes,\\nfinally at peace."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4808\t4918"
msgid "Meanwhile, the \"Dragon of Kansai\" was\\non the move."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4919\t5110"
msgid "He was on his way to the final battle."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5174\t5391"
msgid ""
"Putting aside the struggles between the\\nTojo Clan and the Omi Alliance..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5416\t5596"
msgid ""
"...I headed to where Ryuji awaited me,\\nto settle things "
"man<Sign:22>to<Sign:22>man."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5680\t5880"
msgid ""
"All right! Then we got the stage, we\\ngot the players... Time for the show!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5908\t6075"
msgid "But things took an unexpected turn."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6192\t6278"
msgid "There in front of me was..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6313\t6402"
msgid "...Terada.\\nA man who should have been dead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6453\t6548"
msgid "20 years ago, during the incident\\nat Kamurocho..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6565\t6741"
msgid ""
"...my father had spared the lives of some\\nmembers of the Jingweon Mafia."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6742\t6816"
msgid "Terada was one of them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7021\t7136"
msgid "Consumed by his need for revenge..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7157\t7352"
msgid ""
"...Terada had even faked his own death\\nin order to set his plan into "
"motion."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7360\t7540"
msgid "It'll all be over after I defeat you and\\narm the bomb."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7520\t7660"
msgid "Which means, Kazuma,\\nI'm afraid you'll have to die!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7739\t7809"
msgid "It was a sad fight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7833\t7969"
msgid "Maybe Terada had been prepared to die..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7996\t8103"
msgid "...from the moment he appeared before me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8177\t8364"
msgid "Terada was shot by Takashima,\\nthe true mastermind behind it all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8385\t8508"
msgid "With his final breath, he said to me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8570\t8800"
msgid "Kazuma... You have to trust me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8908\t9060"
msgid ""
"Immediately after those words were spoken,\\na time bomb began its "
"countdown."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9127\t9354"
msgid ""
"Ryuji took advantage of Takashima's\\nmomentary panic and put an end to it "
"all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9588\t9843"
msgid ""
"Thus the curtain fell on the war between\\neast and west, Osaka and Tokyo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9848\t9903"
msgid "But..."
msgstr "Ma..."

msgctxt "9989\t10124"
msgid "As a man, there was one more thing\\nthat I had to do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10145\t10250"
msgid "Let's get this over with, shall we?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10390\t10465"
msgid "Stop it! We have to go!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10500\t10530"
msgid "No."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10540\t10555"
msgid "What?!"
msgstr "Cosa?"

msgctxt "10760\t10840"
msgid "I still have some unfinished business."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10973\t11085"
msgid "December 24th, 2006."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11140\t11351"
msgid "At last my long journey had come to an end."
msgstr ""
